# Rubble Rouser paying for a spell: Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt and pays its {R} with the mana ability, exiling the Memnite. The reflexive
# trigger can't go on the stack while the Bolt is being cast (ruling 2026-03-20); once it is cast the trigger goes above it, so the ping
# resolves first: Bot2 is at 19 after one round of passes, and at 16 when the Bolt has resolved too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Rubble Rouser
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Mountain
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rubble Rouser.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Rubble Rouser.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Rubble Rouser.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Exile.Memnite.Power = 1
